[en.CHARACTER_TRIXIE_LULAMOON_NAME]
Trixie Lulamoon

[en.CHARACTER_TRIXIE_LULAMOON_DESC]
No pony knows the exact origin of Trixie Lulamoon. A slightly credible statement is that she was born in Las Pegasus, and once studied at the School for Gifted Unicorns. She chose to travel alone because of the differences in magic performance ideas with her father. Some ponies say she was the queen of the Crystal Empire, some say she was the warrior who defeated the Ursa Major, and some say she was just an arrogant third-rate trickster magician.
She once ruled Ponyville, which lasted only one day, but she sincerely repented in the end and was forgiven by the residents, including 【CENSORED】 and her friends. Later, she became friends with Starlight Glimmer and together they stopped an invasion of Changelings. When the Ultimate Battle broke out, Trixie was responsible for evacuating the residents, avoiding heavy casualties in Ponyville. Her respectful attitude towards Cozy Glow made her the temporary head of security, and in the following years, through excellent political balancing, an unexpected train accident, a stupid war, and a strange treaty, Trixie was promoted again and again, and was officially ennobled as the Duchess of Ponyville with the support of the citizens.
During Trixie’s tenure, she successfully maintained peace and stability in Ponyville. Although other places were still in turmoil, the residents of Ponyville were well-fed and clothed. Therefore, she was very popular among the ordinary ponies of Ponyville and was considered the most capable politician in Ponyville. But for Trixie, the situation was far from as easy as it seemed. Her unclear relationship with Starlight Glimmer made her subject to questioning from all sides, and as time went on, Cozy Glow became increasingly distrustful of her. At Cozy Glow’s instigation, various factions within Ponyville began to move, intending to challenge the status quo.
Sometimes Trixie would think of a time when she was performing on stage, trying to perform a flawed magic trick under the spotlight, trying to make sure the magic trick didn’t fail, and trying to please the audience below. Now, with the new election approaching, conflicts of interest, and conspiracies, this performance is slowly reaching its climax. Under the spotlight, Trixie doesn’t know if she can continue this performance until the perfect curtain call.
Or, she will fall from grace and leave in disgrace...

[zh.CHARACTER_TRIXIE_LULAMOON_NAME]
特丽克西·卢拉月

[zh.CHARACTER_TRIXIE_LULAMOON_DESC]
没有小马清楚特丽克西·卢拉月具体的来历，一个稍微可信的说法是她出生在洛马基，还曾经在天才独角兽学院里学习过，因为和父亲在魔术表演理念上的差异选择了独自云游四方。有小马称她曾是宝石王国的女王，也有传说说她是击败了大熊的勇士，还有说法是她只是个狂妄自大的三流骗子魔术师。
她曾经统治过小马谷，她的统治仅仅持续了一天时间，但她最后真心悔过，并得到了包括【已和谐】和她的朋友们在内的居民们的原谅。后来她成了星光熠熠的朋友，并与无序一同阻止了一次幻形灵的入侵。而在终局之战爆发时，特丽克西认真负责地执行了自己疏散居民的工作，避免了小马谷在战争中遭受到太大伤亡。而她之后对和煦光流毕恭毕敬的态度也使得她顺利成为了临时安保队长，在之后的几年里，靠着出色的政治平衡术，一场意外的列车事故，一场愚蠢的战争，以及一纸奇怪的条约，特丽克西连连晋升，在民众的支持下被正式册封为小马谷公爵。
特丽克西任期内成功维护了小马谷的和平与安定，尽管其他地方依旧水深火热，但小马谷的居民却能吃穿不愁。也因此她在小马谷的普通民众中很受欢迎，被认为是小马谷最有能力的政治家。但对于特丽克西来说，情况则远没有表面上那么和善友好，和星光熠熠说不清道不明的关系让她受到来自各个方面的质疑，也让煦光流随着时间推移对她越发不信任。在和煦光流的怂恿下，而小马谷内部的各派势力也开始伺机蠢蠢欲动，意图挑战现状。
特丽克西有时会想起自己某次在舞台上表演，那时她正站在聚光灯下努力表演一个错漏百出的魔术，她努力保证魔术不穿帮，还要想办法讨好台下的观众。现在，新的选举临近，利益冲突，阴谋诡计正在让这场表演慢慢走向最后的高潮。聚光灯下，特丽克西不知道自己还能否将这场演出进行下去，直到完美谢幕的那天。
或者，自己将身败名裂，狼狈退场...
